OL,3,GNEWSAApproval of #1.5m regeneration
OL,4,Afunding recommended
OL,5,
OL,6,FFunding for a multi-million pound
OL,7,Fredevelopment project of land that has
OL,8,Fbeen empty for six years has been
OL,9,Frecommended for approval.
OL,11,FIn September, Fenland District Council
OL,12,Fapproved plans for flats and a
OL,13,Fcommercial unit at the empty site in
OL,14,FWisbech's High Street, where two former
OL,15,Fcouncil-owned, Grade II-listed
OL,16,Fbuildings had been demolished in 2020.
OL,18,FThe authority has applied for #1.5m in
OL,19,Ffunding from the Cambridgeshire and
OL,20,FPeterborough Combined Authority, which
OL,21,Fwould contribute to the scheme's
OL,22,Festimated #3.3m cost.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
